WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Open Exchange Rate in Reports to see records with missing rates, grouped by date

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Use Show All or the currency filter, then tap the record to edit

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Enter that day's rate. Here, use 1 AUD = 110.510 JPY

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
If the card's final charge is known, open that record and choose Amount

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Enter AUD 103.25 including fees to calculate the effective rate

6
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Switch to Missing rate to see only records that still need one

7
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:48.000
For records that share a rate, select them in Batch Entry and save

8
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Use Show All to review saved conversions. Original amounts and currencies stay unchanged

9
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:12.067
Tap Done to return to Reports and see the total using the charges and rates entered
